cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MOLE in published work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MOLE: a lightweight molecular viewer with an interactive E vs n plot"
version: 0.3.1
date-released: 2026-11-18
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23963301
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Padalher/MOLE"
abstract: "MOLE is a lightweight molecular viewer for XYZ files with one or more structures, Gaussian and ORCA output files and cube files. It shows the 3D structure next to an interactive E vs n energy plot and playback controls. It draws with the core X11 protocol, so it stays fluid when run on an HPC cluster and viewed over ssh -Y."
keywords:
  - computational chemistry
  - molecular visualization
  - XYZ
  - ORCA
  - Gaussian
  - cube files
  - extended XYZ
  - X11
authors:
